        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6 sm:mb-8">
          Quality is not inspected in at the very end — it is constructed into every structural layer. We implement a non-negotiable multi-stage verification framework before any work is signed off.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">Material Authenticity</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Lab testing and batch certification for all steel and concrete mixes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
