              <h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">Workmanship Audits</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Pre-pour reinforcement and shuttering alignment laser checks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">Structural Gateways</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Independent 3rd-party engineer sign-off at each major milestone.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">MEP Coordination</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Pressure testing plumbing and electrical load mapping before close-in.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase text-on-surface">Daily Site Logs</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Full digital record of weather, manpower, and concrete slump test data.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">check_circle</span>
